SUMMARY:TPEC 2027: Full paper (first period) (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:IEEE Texas Power and Energy Conference (TPEC 2027)\n\nFull pape
 r (first period): 15 Sept 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nConference: Feb
 ruary 7-9\, 2027\nLocation: College Station\, USA\nVenue: Memorial Student
  Center\, Texas A&M University\n\nAll dates:\n  Full paper (first period):
  15 Sept 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Decision (first period): 5 Oct 2
 026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Full paper (second period): 15 Oct 2026\, 
 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Decision (second period): 5 Nov 2026\, 23:59 UTC
 +12 (assumed)\n  Full paper (third period): 15 Nov 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (as
 sumed)\n  Decision (third period): 5 Jan 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\n
 The call for papers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the ea
 rliest it could plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real
  deadline rather than after it.\n\nThree submission periods\; submitting i
 n the first or second earns a cheaper registration rate. Papers are up to 
 6 pages and must be presented in person to reach IEEE Xplore.\n\nCall for 
 papers: https://tpec.engr.tamu.edu/\nDetails: https://langestefan.github.i
 o/powersystem-deadlines/conference/tpec27
LOCATION:College Station\, USA
URL;VALUE=URI:https://tpec.engr.tamu.edu/
CATEGORIES:Power Systems,Power Electronics,Machines & Drives,Energy Markets
 ,Cyber-Physical Security
